# 301 redirect: no-trailing-slash URLs → trailing-slash equivalents
# Cloudflare Pages _redirects format: <source> <destination> <status>
#
# The `*` splat matches all characters greedily, and `:splat` captures it
# into the destination URL. This catches /drum-lessons → /drum-lessons/
# and /blog/some-post → /blog/some-post/ in a single rule.
# Root `/` is a static file served by Astro and won't match `/*`.
# See https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

/*  /:splat/  301
